l>ـٰ</tajweed>نُ وَقَالَ صَوَابًا <span class=end>٣٨</span>","End":"٣٨","PageNumber":583,"JuzNumber":30,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":519,"MaqraNumber":233,"HizbNumber":59,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":78,"SurahIndex":"078","VerseNumber":39,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"ذَٰلِكَ ٱلۡيَوۡمُ ٱلۡحَقُّۖ فَمَن شَآءَ ٱتَّخَذَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِۦ مَـَٔابًا","TajweedText":"ذ<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>لِكَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْيَوْمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَقُّ‌ۖ فَمَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ش</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّخَذَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> مَـَٔـابًا <span class=end>٣٩</span>","End":"٣٩","PageNumber":583,"JuzNumber":30,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":519,"MaqraNumber":233,"HizbNumber":59,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":78,"SurahIndex":"078","VerseNumber":40,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّآ أَنذَرۡنَٰكُمۡ عَذَابٗا قَرِيبٗا يَوۡمَ يَنظُرُ ٱلۡمَرۡءُ مَا قَدَّمَتۡ يَدَاهُ وَيَقُولُ ٱلۡكَافِرُ يَٰلَيۡتَنِي كُنتُ تُرَٰبَۢا","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نذ</tajweed>َرْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كُمْ عَذَا<tajweed class=ikhafa>بًا ق</tajweed>َرِي<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>بًا ي</tajweed>َوْمَ يَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نظ</tajweed>ُرُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَرْءُ مَا قَدَّمَتْ يَدَاهُ وَيَقُولُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكَافِرُ يَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لَيْتَنِى كُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُ تُر<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>بَۢا <span class=end>٤٠</span>","End":"٤٠","PageNumber":583,"JuzNumber":30,"ManzilNumber":7,"RukuNumber":519,"MaqraNumber":233,"HizbNumber":59,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false}]}